--
-- One row per answer. The multi-choice question gets several rows from one
-- participant, which is what the unique key on
-- (participant, question, option) is shaped to allow; the free-text answers
-- get one each, which is what NULLS NOT DISTINCT on that key enforces.
--
-- Only participants with a CompletedAt have answers here.
--

